msgid "Object Avoidance with Dijkstra's"
msgstr "使用 Dijkstra 进行避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstras.rst:10
#: 465b27c97c004de7ab85ca5b13a69b48 9ec74ab41c924c5b851284a86f31d67c
#: af2b55ac06494d8e8be96aabb9f6e1d5 be5667fa598b44ddbe2cfcf6cbfd24f0
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Copter and Rover support `Dijkstra's "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dijkstra%27s_algorithm>`__ for path planning "
"around fences and stay-out zones in Auto, Guided and RTL modes.  This well "
"known algorithm internally builds up a list of \"safe areas\" calculated "
"from the fence and stay-out zones and then finds the shortest path to the "
"destination."
msgstr ""
"Copter 和 Rover 支持 `Dijkstra "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dijkstra%27s_algorithm>`__ 在 Auto、Guided 和 "
"RTL 模式下进行围栏和禁飞区的路径规划。这个著名算法在内部根据围栏和禁飞区建立「安全区域」列表，然后找到到目的地的最短路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstras.rst:16
#: b626e8637e1e4061a53ba1053fabf1c9 ba49223b4eb747f69f6cf23d7b793685
#: d8d64bf68d0e4590b71a62facfd3b449 fb53bfea35d5424f9d3ac9df70957868
msgid ""
"Dijkstra's does not support avoiding objects sensed with lidar or proximity "
"sensors"
msgstr "Dijkstra 不支持规避激光雷达或近距传感器感测到的物体"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstras.rst:20
#: 13e760befa8344c8b42941cd122aec5f ee1b3c7a77674507adf21244b11abddb
#: eee66b38bccf47c792fac10431c539e3 fdc82863166c4afa88f18c2978798ca1
msgid "Dijkstra's does not support Spline Waypoints."
msgstr "Dijkstra 不支持样条航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstras.rst:23
#: 06acefa14a194f6191fed131f51ccf2c ba207f41b80d4f4581b9cd5806c69e64
#: c9cb3288d6814abeaade1249650f1c0c deb2e55cd2d04a18baea69231c8808c6
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstras.rst:25
#: 3c65bd74c47945448bba9806dda4fb84 6cfc7b792fbe48af94c8497e4a7773ad
#: b0c25c9769fa4cc78936efdd9066bf9a c7ff3cc73aed48a391a1009862b68b5c
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_TYPE <OA_TYPE>` = 2 (Dijkstra).  You may need to refresh parameters"
" after changing this to see the parameters below."
msgstr ":ref:`OA_TYPE <OA_TYPE>` = 2（Dijkstra）。更改此参数后，您可能需要刷新参数才能看到以下参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstras.rst:26
#: 3d8616b5be134409a2796919054047ce 3ea3df5610464cfcbcf66dc7d4cfe90b
#: b3bb3a5106b943fdaeb502d4094bf58f dfca436707a8450a9ebe1f891b2e235f
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_MARGIN_MAX <OA_MARGIN_MAX>`: the distance (in meters) that the "
"vehicle should stay away from the fences and stay-out zones"
msgstr ":ref:`OA_MARGIN_MAX <OA_MARGIN_MAX>`：飞行器应与围栏和禁飞区保持的距离（单位：米）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstras.rst:27
#: 1b8d831f4b604672aa13e13399a1b65b bb5e0ba6325d41899fbe75923b059ef8
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_OPTIONS<OA_OPTIONS>` bit 2 (+4 to the value) can be set to use "
"S-Curves around fence corners in the planned path to speed up turns. Note "
"that using S-Curves, instead of the normal \"approach,stop, turn, proceed\" "
"method of path planning around sharp fence corners, could still result in a "
"fence breach.To avoid this :ref:`WPNAV_RADIUS<WPNAV_RADIUS>` should be set "
"smaller than :ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>`. Also waypoints should also "
"be placed at least 10m from fence boundaries."
msgstr ""
":ref:`OA_OPTIONS<OA_OPTIONS>` 第 2 位（值加 4）可设置为在规划路径的围栏拐角处使用 S "
"曲线以加速转弯。请注意，在绕过尖锐围栏拐角的路径规划中使用 S "
"曲线（而不是普通的「接近、停止、转弯、继续」方法）仍可能导致围栏突破。为避免这种情况，应将 "
":ref:`WPNAV_RADIUS<WPNAV_RADIUS>` 设置为小于 "
":ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>`。此外，航点也应距围栏边界至少 10m。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-dijkstras.rst:29
#: cc7e9a3fe52c4b48b7f4a59ef21f5d71 de72e05695fc48c0b707c94e0e7d4aac
msgid ""
"For use in :ref:`Guided mode <ac2_guidedmode>`, set "
":ref:`GUID_OPTIONS<GUID_OPTIONS>` bit 6 (e.g. 64)"
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`Guided 模式 <ac2_guidedmode>` 下使用时，请设置 "
":ref:`GUID_OPTIONS<GUID_OPTIONS>` 第 6 位（例如 64）"

